 "remarks": "Start your morning in a bright, modern eat-in kitchen, then step onto your private terrace with coffee in hand. Everyday convenience is built in. Your own washer and dryer are in the unit, so there are no laundry trips or coin machines to deal with. When you return home, pull directly into your parking space and head upstairs to unwind. With 2 bedrooms, 1 bath, and approximately 800 square feet of living space, the layout gives you room to spread out, work from home, and comfortably host friends or family. The location is just as appealing. You are less than a mile from the heart of South Norwalk, with its restaurants, cafes, shops, and nightlife. Beaches, parks, and the waterfront are only minutes away. Whether you are commuting, meeting friends for dinner, or enjoying the coast, everything is close by. Features residents love: * In unit washer and dryer * One parking space included could fit 2 small cars in tandem* Private outdoor terrace * Pet friendly * Walkable neighborhood near SONO * Extra parking space available for $50 per month * Private storage room available storage available at additional monthly charge * Pet rent: $350 per year A spacious townhouse style home in a location that puts everything within reach. Come see it for yourself.",
